<BaseLayout title="FAQ — Nexauren Hub Online Tools" description="Answers about Nexauren Hub tools, supported formats, browser-side processing, accounts and future plans.">
<main id="main-content" class="page-main"><div class="container narrow-container"><nav class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>FAQ</span></nav><header class="page-hero compact-hero"><span class="eyebrow">HELP CENTRE</span><h1>Frequently asked <span class="gradient-text">questions.</span></h1><p>Quick answers about the tool library, files, privacy and future features.</p></header>
<div class="faq-list"><section><h2>Using the tools</h2><details open><summary>Are Nexauren Hub tools free?</summary><p>The current online tool collection is free. Optional advanced services may be considered in the future, but no paid checkout is active.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need to register?</summary><p>No account is needed for public tools. Email/password registration, email verification, password recovery and Google sign-in are handled by Firebase when the corresponding provider is enabled in project settings.</p></details><details><summary>Why is a file type not supported?</summary><p>Support depends on browser capabilities and each tool's implementation. Audio codec support varies and large files may exceed device memory.</p></details><details><summary>Can I use the tools on a phone?</summary><p>The website adapts to mobile screens. Large files can take longer on phones, so try smaller files if a task runs out of memory.</p></details></section>
<section><h2>Privacy and files</h2><details><summary>Are my files uploaded?</summary><p>The current image, PDF, text and audio processing tools run in the browser. The website still delivers pages and assets, and the hosting provider may process ordinary technical logs.</p></details><details><summary>Are my files stored after I close the page?</summary><p>The tools do not include account-based or remote file storage. Download any result you want to keep before closing the page.</p></details><details><summary>What if a tool does not work?</summary><p>Try a supported format, a smaller file and an updated browser. Use the Contact page when a support address has been configured.</p></details></section>
<section><h2>Accounts and future features</h2><details><summary>Can I create an account today?</summary><p>Not yet. Yes. Firebase Authentication handles account creation and login. Email/password users may need to verify their email; Google sign-in requires the provider to be enabled in Firebase Console.</p></details><details><summary>What does Upgrade do?</summary><p>The upgrade page describes future possibilities. It does not charge users and no payment system is connected.</p></details></section>
</div></div></main>
</BaseLayout>